EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I want some huuuuge furniture!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If you find any, bring it to me,
will you?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Quiero muebles enoooormes!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
